    "source_text": "Jo, tak to je moje prínce zná."
  },
  {
    "start_s": 135.91,
    "end_s": 137.91,
    "source_text": "Tu takhle vopčas pohozim,"
  },
  {
    "start_s": 137.91,
    "end_s": 139.91,
    "source_text": "to je kočička."
  },
  {
    "start_s": 139.91,
    "end_s": 141.91,
    "source_text": "Do you like the bicycle, right?"
